<title>USA: TABLE-Watts Industries Inc Q4 June 30 net.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Watts Industries Inc Q4 June 30 net.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH ANDOVER, Mass. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			  1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.42   profit	 $0.21</p>
<p> Net profit		11,475   profit	 6,077</p>
<p> Sales		    185,921		  170,331</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,355		   28,804</p>
<p>					 12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.89     loss	 $1.70</p>
<p> Net profit		51,747     loss	50,285</p>
<p> Sales		    720,340		  640,876</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,433		   29,527</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 three-month period includes a gain of $1,254,000, or $0.04 per share, from discontinued operations. Excluding the gain, per-share net income would have been $0.17.</p>
<p>The 1997 12-month period includes a gain of $3,208,000, or $0.12 per share, from a gain on the disposal of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The 1996 12-month period includes a gain of $3,480,000, or $0.12 per share, from discontinued operations. The 1996 12-month period includes restructuring charges totaling $25.4 million, and charges totaling $63.07 million from accounting related to the impairment of long-lived assets.</p>
